# EMAIL SEGMENTATION SYSTEM
## 4 Newsletter Variants for Different Audience Segments

---

## SEGMENT OVERVIEW

Each segment receives a completely different email experience tailored to their specific needs and context.

### Segment 1: WORKERS' RIGHTS DIGEST
**Audience:** Injured workers, WSIB claimants, workplace advocates  
**Percentage:** ~35% of list  
**Send day:** Thursday at 9 AM  
**Frequency:** 2x per week  
**Subject line style:** Deadline-urgent, action-oriented, empowering

### Segment 2: BENEFITS NAVIGATION DIGEST
**Audience:** People seeking/managing disability income programs  
**Percentage:** ~30% of list  
**Send day:** Wednesday at 9 AM  
**Frequency:** Bi-weekly (1st & 15th)  
**Subject line style:** Educational, progress-focused, hopeful

### Segment 3: ACCESSIBILITY WINS DIGEST
**Audience:** Accessibility advocates, accessibility policy followers  
**Percentage:** ~20% of list  
**Send day:** Monday at 9 AM  
**Frequency:** Weekly  
**Subject line style:** Inspiring, barrier-breaking, progress-driven

### Segment 4: COMMUNITY ACTION DIGEST
**Audience:** Community organizers, activists, event-focused readers  
**Percentage:** ~15% of list  
**Send day:** Friday at 9 AM  
**Frequency:** Weekly  
**Subject line style:** Participation-driven, urgency, solidarity

