## IMPLEMENTATION STEPS

### 1. Email Service Setup
- Choose email platform: MailChimp, ConvertKit, or GetResponse
- Create 4 separate email templates
- Set up custom fields for segment tracking

### 2. Signup Form Enhancement
Update newsletter signup to ask:
```
What topics matter most to you? (Select all that apply)
[ ] Workers' Rights & WSIB
[ ] Disability Benefits
[ ] Accessibility
[ ] Community Events
```

### 3. List Segmentation
Create automation:
- If "Workers' Rights" selected → Add to Workers' Digest list
- If "Disability Benefits" selected → Add to Benefits Digest list
- If "Accessibility" selected → Add to Accessibility Wins list
- If "Community Events" selected → Add to Community Action list

### 4. Scheduling
- Workers' Rights: Thursdays, 9 AM (2x/week)
- Benefits: Wednesdays, 9 AM (bi-weekly)
- Accessibility: Mondays, 9 AM (weekly)
- Community Action: Fridays, 9 AM (weekly)

### 5. Testing
- Send to test addresses
- Review for mobile responsiveness
- Check all links work
- Verify segment routing

### 6. Analytics Tracking
Monitor per segment:
- Open rate
- Click rate
- Unsubscribe rate
- Engagement time
- Conversion (action taken)

